{"id":1750725,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-17T11:47:38.193Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1750725,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Cinta 100kg","overview":"# Love 100kg  The story follows two friends who struggle in their quest to find true love. Wati (Sharifah Amani) and Dian (Sherry Al Hadad) are two women who are lacking in physical appearance. Wati, who has a tomboyish personality, feels she is unattractive in the eyes of men. Meanwhile, her friend Dian has a serious weight problem. This causes Dian to constantly feel insecure about herself compared to women who are much more beautiful than her. After Wati breaks up with her boyfriend, Faliq, Wati starts going to the gym as a hobby. At the gym, Wati meets the gym owner, the handsome Shahril (Zain Saidin). From that day on, Wati becomes increasingly obsessed with Shahril. Almost every day, Wati tells Dian about Shahril, which causes Dian to become sick of Wati's obsession with him. However, at the same time, Dian is facing a crisis with her boyfriend, Khairul (Fezrul Khan), who works as a pilot.","popularity":0.0071,"poster_path":"/lxRZ34gDNPCvBXBEcwcOr3THKeJ.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2016-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Cinta 100kg","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1531918,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Sherry Alhadad","original_name":"Sherry Alhadad","popularity":0.4487,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a81bd4a72da8ab880f8055e","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":127086,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Sharifah Amani","original_name":"Sharifah Amani","popularity":0.4939,"profile_path":"/627J8EL6KriLOIshPwHQHOzv3M